1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,580
Every great startup begins with an idea.

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:07,190
But an idea alone doesn't build a successful company.

3
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:11,547
Behind every successful business are hundreds of decisions

4
00:00:11,547 --> 00:00:15,225
involving market research, financial planning, technology,

5
00:00:15,225 --> 00:00:17,000
competition and regulations.

6
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,036
But what happens when you're a solo founder?

7
00:00:20,036 --> 00:00:23,270
Or a small team without access to experienced executives?

8
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:26,028
You might build something nobody needs,

9
00:00:26,028 --> 00:00:28,820
enter a market already dominated by competitors,

10
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:32,437
or overlook regulations that could prevent your business

11
00:00:32,437 --> 00:00:33,280
from operating.

12
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:36,938
We believe founders shouldn't have to figure everything

13
00:00:36,938 --> 00:00:37,490
out alone.

14
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:41,716
What if you could bring together a CEO, CFO, CTO,

15
00:00:41,716 --> 00:00:44,304
CMO and other specialised executives,

16
00:00:44,304 --> 00:00:47,730
without actually hiring an entire executive team?

17
00:00:48,270 --> 00:00:50,044
That's why we built EXECORA:

18
00:00:50,044 --> 00:00:53,339
an AI-powered virtual boardroom where specialised AI

19
00:00:53,339 --> 00:00:55,811
agents and human teammates collaborate,

20
00:00:55,811 --> 00:00:59,169
debate business ideas, challenge assumptions and help

21
00:00:59,169 --> 00:01:01,260
founders make informed decisions.

22
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:04,547
And the collaboration happens through Switch,

23
00:01:04,547 --> 00:01:07,489
bringing human teammates and specialised AI agents

24
00:01:07,489 --> 00:01:09,430
together in one shared workspace.

25
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,660
Let's step inside our boardroom.

26
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,370
Welcome to the EXECORA boardroom.

27
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:18,168
Here, every agent has a specialised executive

28
00:01:18,168 --> 00:01:19,190
responsibility.

29
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:22,932
Our CEO leads the strategic discussion and coordinates

30
00:01:22,932 --> 00:01:23,530
decisions.

31
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,085
Our market research agent investigates customer demand,

32
00:01:27,085 --> 00:01:28,880
industry trends and competitors.

33
00:01:29,370 --> 00:01:31,861
Our CFO evaluates financial viability,

34
00:01:31,861 --> 00:01:34,090
costs and business sustainability.

35
00:01:34,570 --> 00:01:37,145
Our CTO examines technical feasibility,

36
00:01:37,145 --> 00:01:39,060
architecture and scalability.

37
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:42,066
And our CMO focuses on marketing strategy,

38
00:01:42,066 --> 00:01:44,380
positioning and customer acquisition.

39
00:01:44,910 --> 00:01:47,800
Together, they form a virtual executive team.

40
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,341
Every question opens a thread,

41
00:01:50,341 --> 00:01:52,930
and that's where the AI agents interact.

42
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:56,584
These agents don't simply generate isolated responses.

43
00:01:56,584 --> 00:01:59,015
They collaborate in one shared conversation,

44
00:01:59,015 --> 00:02:01,999
challenge each other's assumptions and bring different

45
00:02:01,999 --> 00:02:04,320
perspectives to the same business problem.

46
00:02:04,810 --> 00:02:06,997
And founders can actively participate,

47
00:02:06,997 --> 00:02:09,760
question the agents and influence the decisions.

48
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:13,949
Under the hood, Switch Console runs every executive as its

49
00:02:13,949 --> 00:02:17,071
own live agent. Each role, and the shared boardroom

50
00:02:17,071 --> 00:02:20,253
protocol, lives on GitHub, so anyone can rebuild the

51
00:02:20,253 --> 00:02:20,620
board.

52
00:02:21,570 --> 00:02:24,110
Every meeting ends with a decision you can act on:

53
00:02:24,510 --> 00:02:25,550
a board resolution.

54
00:02:26,250 --> 00:02:28,500
And next, from our own board's roadmap:

55
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:31,434
debates grounded in your company data,

56
00:02:31,434 --> 00:02:35,280
finance and CRM connectors, and a saved decision history.

57
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:39,173
We believe access to strategic expertise shouldn't depend

58
00:02:39,173 --> 00:02:41,700
on the size of your company or your funding.

59
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:45,448
Whether you're a solo founder or an early-stage team,

60
00:02:45,448 --> 00:02:47,360
your ideas deserve a boardroom.

61
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:48,750
EXECORA.

62
00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:52,700
Think together. Decide smarter. Build bigger.
